// Title: Heartbeat gaps (flapping machines)
// Source: Log Analytics
// Tables: Heartbeat
// When to use: A VM that is up now but dropped out several times today. Catches flaky network or agent restarts that a point-in-time check misses.
// Tune: Gap threshold 5m. Machines with 3+ gaps are worth a look.

Heartbeat
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| project Computer, TimeGenerated
| sort by Computer asc, TimeGenerated asc
| extend PrevTime = prev(TimeGenerated), PrevComputer = prev(Computer)
| where Computer == PrevComputer
| extend Gap = TimeGenerated - PrevTime
| where Gap > 5m
| summarize Gaps = count(), LongestGap = max(Gap), LastGapAt = max(PrevTime) by Computer
| order by Gaps desc
